{"id":"u-d235cb0a-ee7b-4492-87d6-e08a614aa3f4","src":"community","title":"IRON UNION","author":"Taylor W.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/PnT8qT-iron-union","desc":"IRON UNION exists to build real strength, lasting conditioning, and disciplined consistency through heavy training and shared effort. This program is designed to move away from trend based workouts and focus on time tested lifts, structured progression, and intentional conditioning that translates to real life performance. IRON UNION emphasizes barbell strength, controlled intensity, and core stability to improve durability, confidence, and physical capability. It is built for individuals and couples who want to train hard, stay accountable, and grow stronger together without shortcuts. Every session is designed to challenge the body while reinforcing proper movement, mental toughness, and long term sustainability. The purpose is not just aesthetic change, but building a body that can handle load, stress, and daily demands with confidence. IRON UNION is about earning progress through effort, staying consistent, and committing to strength as a lifestyle, not a phase.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":10,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T16:00:10.803Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["IRON PRESS (Chest)","FOUNDATION (Legs)","THE ANVIL (Back)","OVERHEAD (Shoulders)","THE UNION (Full Body)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8},{"r":10,"rpe":8},{"r":8,"rpe":8},{"r":6,"rpe":8},{"r":4,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8},{"r":10,"rpe":8},{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Bench Pullover","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Close Grip)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Dip (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets"